Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NightCondition with Rainy Weather" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition ;
    :description "The road is wet due to rain, affecting visibility and traction." .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential for collision due to poor visibility and slippery roads." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential for collision due to poor visibility and slippery roads.
Severity Score: 0.75